        "text_company_profile": "Company Profile",
        "text_homepage_about_us": "<div class='home-aboutus aboutus-custom'><strong >Xiangying Glass Hardware Factory </strong>has 15 years of export experience and enjoys a good reputation for the industry, especially in Canada, US and Australia. We mainly produce door handles, shower hinges and sliding door accessories, etc.  <br /><br />We have advanced production equipment and a numbers of skillful technical workers and we can offer you with the high quality products at a competitive price. <br /><br /><strong>We have also formed long-term cooperation with internationally renowned companies such as KFC and Pizza Hut to provide them with glass door accessories.  </strong><br /><br /> We welcome all enquiries regarding Glass and Aluminium for Domestic, Architectural and Commercial applications. If you are interested in our product, please feel free to contact us. </div>",
        "about_us_advantages": {
            "title1": "High Quality",
            "desc1": "Xiangying's mission is to always adhere to making good products that are 'perfect and affordable'.",
            "title2": "Professional Team",
            "desc2": "We have many skilled technicians who have worked for us for many years. It has always been our philosophy to provide customers with products of consistent quality and high quality",
            "title3": "Fast Delivery",
            "desc3": "We have many years of export experience. No matter which city you are, we can transport the goods to your place as scheduled",
            "title4": "OEM/ODM Service",
            "desc4": "We have many years OEM experience for clients mainly from North America and Europe."  
        }
